<title>USA: Teledata plans follow-on offering.</title>
<headline>Teledata plans follow-on offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teledata Communications said its board has authorized a public offering of Teledata ordinary shares and the filing of a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Final details have not been decided, but the company anticipates selling up to 1.1 million ordinary shares in the proposed offering. It said shareholders are also considering joining the proposed offer and selling up to 1.6 million ordinary shares.</p>
</text>
